# Stack: Python FastAPI

Package choices only. Trees and seams live in `backend-python-fastapi-architecture-patterns`. Attach with the FastAPI preset.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| Package / deps | uv | `pyproject` + uv (or `requirements/` if already present) |
| HTTP | FastAPI | |
| Schemas | Pydantic v2 | Prefer over raw dicts for request/response |
| ORM (optional) | SQLAlchemy 2.0 | When ORM features are used |
| Async DB | asyncpg or aiomysql | Match the database |
| Tests | pytest | L2 HTTP client: httpx against the app |
| Lint / format | ruff | |
| Types | mypy | Prefer in CI when the service is typed |
